From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWWorm <noreply@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:28:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prepare temporal scene shaders in the background

The motion vector shader group compiles at low priority; until it is
ready the scene draws with a spatial copy.
---
